Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really have a\Ndoctor take a look at that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I already know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want you to give me a bit\Nof first aid in the meantime!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, take it easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Fugo, you're not gonna -
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Heyyyyyy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that just happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, you sealed him\Nup like a freaking monk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Narancia, you mind grabbing the\Nduct tape and wrapping up his midsection?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This hack job isn't going\Nto get infected, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually kind of growing on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,May I chime in?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Vagazzi, you've made me proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to all of your efforts\Nthat we made it to Capri alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our would-be attackers have been neutralized\Nand are being held on the ship for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The obstacle has been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.14,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time like the present!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,our 10 billion lira treasure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.44,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A hidden safe at the bank? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.80,0:01:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have buried it in\Nsome cave on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.74,0:01:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to wait a little longer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do we need to wait around?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you wait a few?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still some people left in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, think you could\Nclean this place later?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.38,0:01:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.74,0:01:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,La Toilette?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If your name was La Toilette, that'd make\Nthis place your house, giving you a say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, one calls the\Nshots in their own home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, if this isn't\Nactually your house,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,then you really have no\Nbusiness ordering me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of comeback later\Ndon't you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:01:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, user?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll slice you apart! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off now, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to cut this fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Things aren't as they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That stern voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, bow your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pericolo, a capo from Passione.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come all the way here\Nfor the 10 billion lira.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:03:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.27,0:03:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,our channel for more videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,FIGHTING GOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I reached out to him\Nas soon as we arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pericolo was kind enough to meet\Nall of us here to receive the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's a capo from Passione.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We are humbled by your visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,None of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who requested your\Nteam travel here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, everyone at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be the rookie, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Si.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati's told me all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You are with Passione now, which\Nmakes you part of the Familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we've only just met, but by\Nall means, call me Mr. Pericolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sunny, pardon the\Nrough reception earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She hates it when people touch\Nher without her permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's yes, sir! Mr. Pericolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may, why the elaborate disguise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I have my reasons,\Nbut I'll clarify later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Before that, are you\Npositive that you have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The 10 billion lira contribution\Nto the Familia? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Back it up a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it's here! But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to be more specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but all I see are urinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You hid it inside of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't deny it was secure,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but holy moly if those guys\Nknew what they were pissing on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it's authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This necklace alone is worth at\Nleast seven or eight hundred million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, I won't badger you for details\Non how you obtained this cache of riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The familiar cares not about your methods,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,only that you follow\Nthrough with the funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hang on, you're\Nputting it away already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I touch it a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd settle for a whiff!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:06:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This treasure is proof\Nincarnate that the man standing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,before us today is one of\Ntremendous intellect and faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Bucciarati. You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby promote you to the rank of Kapo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After all that,\NBucciarati's finally a capo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Polpo is no longer among the living,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you are now the successor to\Nthe entirety of his territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll oversee all interests\Nrelated to the Familia in Napoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,including gambling, extortion,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,port contraband, and restaurant\Nand hotel operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,50% goes to the Familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is yours for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So much power just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With Bucciarati's smarts and charisma,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,our little gang is going\Nto be rolling in dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it's like everything started being\Nset into motion once that new guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a crazy good luck charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:06:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you haven't had time to digest\Nyour new duties as Polpo's successor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but you should know he still\Nhad one job left unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, this responsibility\Nwill now rest on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to\Naccept his final mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a heavy burden to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm to finish what he started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.76,0:07:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Be aware this is a direct\Norder from the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the same boss no\None's ever met in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we're getting\Nan order right from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deliver his words myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mission is to safeguard\Nthe boss's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Laying down your lives if\Nneeded. End of message. His
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,daughter the boss did he\Nsay daughter the daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,of the boss we were planning\Non tracking down and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,eliminating your safeguarding\Nobligations begin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:08:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm turning her over\Nto you turning her over
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati could that guy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,be no that woman she must
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Be the boss's daughter?\NCould that really be her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.94,0:08:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,i have to well you know\Nthat's fine go ahead trish
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,for now stay by her side\Nshe is now our priority
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,her name is trish una and\Nshe's 15 years old the name una
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,comes from her mother so it has\Nno association with the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish has also never met the boss, so\Nshe doesn't know anything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, as you know, no one has\Nknowledge of the boss's true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course, even someone\Nlike the boss has a past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,His youth is especially intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Two months ago, in a hospital\Nin a small town in Calabria,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,a woman named Donatella succumbed to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.62,0:09:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.53,0:09:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just days before her death,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,she initiated a frantic search\Nfor a man named Solido Naso.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The man she was looking\Nfor was Trish's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume it was a final act of love for a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,daughter who'd soon be\Nleft to fend for herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't find him\Nbecause he doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just an alias used by the boss in\Nhis youth to conceal his true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But he who seeks Nazo\Nmust exercise caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone with any standing whatsoever in\NPassione knows to take these words to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To peer into the depths of the boss's\Npast is to defy the familia itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Word of Donatella spread like wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can imagine, with news\Nof a daughter, rumors exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the hearsay\Nreached the boss too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His resolution was unsurprisingly swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,By way of several intermediaries,\Nhe extended his order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon Donatella's death, I\Nwas to become her guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have known instinctively.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He lived his life without\Nknowing she had ever existed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,yet suddenly he knew Trish\Nwas his own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shortly after taking\NTrish into my custody,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I discovered someone was attempting to hunt\Nher down and take the girl out for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Had the directive\Narrived 30 minutes later,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no doubt Trisha's pursuers\Nwould have taken her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They would have surely killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But who'd do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would want to kill\Nthe boss's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitors to the familia, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no telling how many there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They are attempting to\Noverthrow the boss and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,take control of all the\Ndrug trafficking routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Drugs again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:11:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,These idiotas have convinced themselves the\Ngirl possesses secret intel on the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They want intelligence on how to topple\Nthe boss when they carry out their coup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.74,0:11:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But she has no such knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish is a vulnerable teen\Nin a strange new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will we protect her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,About seven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And likely it'll be\Neven shorter than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be relieved of duty once\Nthe boss eliminates the traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this island immediately\Nand place her under concealment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This arrangement is top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the boss and I know of it. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pericolo, to clarify, this\Nmission was first Polpo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Signore?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That our enemies are stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say that is a good guess, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In all likelihood, they'll\Nbe working in teams as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we don't yet\Nknow how many there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't possess a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've now done everything\NI can to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I obtain further intel,\NI'll find a way to reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.52,0:12:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the group that'll be\Nescorting me from here on out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The six of us are here for you, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're with us, we will\Nprotect you with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please take off\Nyour jacket for just a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to take off my jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, just take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I have no interest in\Nseeing you devoid of clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made that clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:13:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of handkerchiefs, so go\Nbuy me one While you're at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,get more nylons and\NGivenchy blush number two
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.29,0:13:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and those nylons better be\Nthe ones with the garter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,At the thigh. And grab a\Ncopy of Vogitalia Mineral.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,water would be nice too But\Nit has to be from France
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather keel over than\Ndrink that other stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're done ogling the\Nscenery, get started on that list
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the daughter of the boss, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute we're hunting the bastard down,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and the next we're face to\Nface with his flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, this has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If we really follow through on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the boss will give Bucerati the\Nsame kind of trust he gave Polpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we fail, our story won't end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone aboard this ship is\Naware of that cruel reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.32,0:13:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Chill out, sweetie baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to show you some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.98,0:14:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit moving around so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.02,0:14:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm trying\Nto read these messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,At 9.25 this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,officials at the prison\Nin Naples were shocked
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,to discover that Polpo\Nhad shot himself dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure Popo\Nwould be the girl's guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not him, who is it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd stick their neck out to look\Nafter that disappearing actress?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I better get after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Find them, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would be more capable\Nof protecting her than Popo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They definitely have to be a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else would be assigned\Nto such an important job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.60,0:14:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Them being a stand user\Nis also a no-brainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is, who the\Nhell checks all those boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Groceries, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Surroundings clear. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm supposed to go through\Nhere, make a turn there,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.58,0:15:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,end up back on this street, and\Nthen head in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a list of groceries from the\Ngroup, along with everything else we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And these are the keys to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be a walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has the faintest idea\Nour group is hiding out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the vintners out front\Nare aware of our presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're done with the shopping,\NI want you to retrace your path,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,then do it again more times\Nthan you think necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.84,0:15:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, make a U-turn every once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That way you'll know whether\Nanyone is tailing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I want you to take the\Ncar I left for you in the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then and only then do I\Nwant you to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No one should have any inkling that\Nwe're looking after the boss's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But just in case someone\Ndoes know what we're up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,this runaround strategy should\Nkeep them off our trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.47,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the things on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That much is still true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's absolutely imperative\Nthat nobody finds our hideout!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it! I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, now repeat everything we\Njust discussed, start to finish. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I buy all the stuff on the list, then drive\Naround and around in a field, until...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the wrong answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit screwing around and get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me what I said\Nfrom the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,drive around an empty\Nlot so I don't get dizzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seeing this, Abbacchio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to stop stabbing\Nme with the damn keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should have put him in charge\Nof shopping in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you two man-babies want to keep\Nplaying with keys is your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,As for me, I'm interested\Nin Narancia's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're being followed, he'll put\Nan end to them before they know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.10,0:17:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Bucciarati\Ngave him the task he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Long story short, I need to get my\Nass back here without a soul knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.26,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No stalkers allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.08,0:17:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes tell me I'm all\Nby myself, but my gut says
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,otherwise and if that wasn't\Nbad enough this car Fugo got me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,has given off some bad vibes\Ntoo come on now already
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying to know where oh\Nwhere could you be heading to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It came from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, like I said, where are\Nyou running off to, stranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep looking behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Worried some big bad boogeyman\Nis following you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you act so scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how you treat\Nsomeone asking you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you'd be so rude,\Nanswering a question with a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your face, freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you out of this car right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't getting us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me Formaggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm part of the Familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.12,0:18:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You are aware that Polpo\Npassed last night, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trusty team...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Merida!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how this guy found out\Nabout our mission, but he's on to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Naracha, this is the rudest welcome ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives, amigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Bucciarati and the\Nrest of your playmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No clue, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.98,0:18:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I know where they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not their keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.52,0:19:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you check the restaurants around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This car you're using,\Nit's a rental, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And Bucciarati is the renter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you be in this car if\Nyou weren't aware of that? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I always drive around in his cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 17, so I clearly don't have my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm borrowing his.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Polpo's colossal corpse\Nis causing the mortician.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,trouble because he doesn't\Nknow how to torch the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to squeeze\Nhim into the damn oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he'll just have to hack\Nthat fat calzone into tiny pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You shut up! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you thinking the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you totally fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:19:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.02,0:20:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Say no, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you fools nowhere to be seen\Nwhile a capo is being laid to rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to snitching already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have all day to\Nfollow your ass around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm finished, kid, you\Nwon't have a secret left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat shit. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Better yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.24,0:20:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lil' bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.02,0:20:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him, tiny feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at what you did to me, bastardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.60,0:20:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Frickin' hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's a psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:21:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, die, die, die! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.00,0:21:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slaughter you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This crazy kid's\Ncompletely blown a gasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's shooting everything\Nin sight like a madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm stuck inside this\Ntin can with nowhere to hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying in this car's gonna do me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.26,0:21:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow him away, little bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.02,0:21:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You a pile of ash yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! We get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the blast knock him\Ninto the stratosphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but there's not a piece of him left!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so oblivious, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.78,0:21:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right under your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can micrify myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.86,0:21:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my very secret weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand is called Tiny Feet, and all the\Nother guys said it wasn't worth anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.18,0:22:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They can talk shit till\Nthey're blue in the face,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.02,0:22:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but personal talent is\Nall about how you use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.06,0:22:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.34,0:22:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see him anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.58,0:22:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.26,0:22:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.88,0:22:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The same damn thing happened when\Nhe first showed up in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can look around to your\Nheart's content I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,buy some time while you parade\Naround looking like a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.70,0:22:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.04,0:22:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know the bastards\Nbuying stuff for a chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got nylons and lipstick in there\NThere's even some designer blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's all this shit for?\NKagakatsu's mom or big sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Women are super picky\Nabout stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.98,0:22:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They buy their own makeup and clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.98,0:22:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The only chick who can trust a\Nguy with this kind of thing is one
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,who thinks they would be in mortal\Ndanger if they went outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.04,0:22:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This all stinks to high heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:23:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's looking like my instincts\Nwere spot on after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones chosen to protect the boss's\Ndaughter was Bucerati and his back scratchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.80,0:23:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.70,0:23:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find their hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And the best part is, Narachi\Nis going to show me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My power should be working\Nits magic on him any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard's got to be\Naround here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.68,0:23:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's waiting to\Nfollow me back to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him try.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to shake off this\Nstalker and get back to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.38,0:23:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he tries to get\Nin my way, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This mission is in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You
